  "body": "Built to last, this solid brick and concrete block home has been renovated to a very high standard, combining enduring construction with fresh, modern finishes throughout. \r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is a stunning Shane George designer kitchen, crafted with exceptional attention to detail and featuring a Gaggenau hob and leathered granite benchtops. It is as beautiful as it is functional, ideal for everyday family meals or entertaining in style.\r\n\r\nThe layout is both thoughtful and practical, with one bedroom and one bathroom on each level, providing privacy and convenience for families, guests or flexible living arrangements. A dedicated study offers a quiet space for working from home or helping with homework, while a single garage adds secure off-street parking. \r\n\r\nEvery level feels complete, and quality is evident at every turn. \r\n\r\nHomes of this calibre are seldom available, so be quick to view.\r\n\r\nAuction: On Site 2:00p.m. Wednesday 16th December (unless sold prior)",
